{"id":"wb-4-63","name":"汉楚王墓群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"漢楚王墓群","text":"汉楚王墓群位于江苏省徐州市，1996年11月被列入第四批全国重点文物保护单位，主要包括：\n\n楚王山汉楚王墓群\n狮子山汉楚王墓及陪葬兵马俑坑\n北洞山汉楚王墓\n龟山汉楚王墓\n驮篮山汉楚王墓\n东洞山汉楚王墓\n南洞山汉楚王墓\n卧牛山汉楚王墓\n2006年5月，徐州汉代采石场遗址被列入第六批全国重点文物保护单位，同时归入第四批全国重点文物保护单位汉楚王墓群。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%BC%A2%E6%A5%9A%E7%8E%8B%E5%A2%93%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":93084257,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93084257","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/cca12820369d4ce79c5be144.jpg","title":"20240809_Shizishan_tomb.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240809_Shizishan_tomb.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1b/20240809_Shizishan_tomb.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Yumeto","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Shizishan tomb of the prince (wang) of Chu","width":320,"height":240}}